    "Every exercise is done." : {

    },
    "Every exercise, its 3D model, setup and key tips, the workout log, history, recovery and Preset 1 are free. MUSQ Premium adds the common mistakes drawn over the lifter, Preset 2 and 3 for every muscle group and no ads, plus Ask MUSQ, the AI coach (up to %lld questions a day), and one goal photo to try (for adults). MUSQ Pro has everything in Premium, with up to %lld questions a day, meal scans that log a meal's calories from a photo (up to %lld a day) and %lld goal photos a month." : {
      "comment" : "Text for the AI features in MUSQ. The first argument is the number of questions the AI can answer daily. The second argument is the number of questions the AI can answer daily. The third argument is the number of goal photos allowed per month.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Every exercise, its 3D model, setup and key tips, the workout log, history, recovery and Preset 1 are free. MUSQ Premium adds the common mistakes drawn over the lifter, Preset 2 and 3 for every muscle group and no ads, plus Ask MUSQ, the AI coach (up to %1$lld questions a day), and one goal photo to try (for adults). MUSQ Pro has everything in Premium, with up to %2$lld questions a day, meal scans that log a meal's calories from a photo (up to %3$lld a day) and %4$lld goal photos a month."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every exercise, its 3D model, setup and key tips, the workout log, history, recovery and Preset 1 are free. MUSQ Premium adds the common mistakes drawn over the lifter, Preset 2 and 3 for every muscle group, and removes ads." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mọi bài tập, mô hình 3D, cách chuẩn bị và lưu ý chính, nhật ký tập, lịch sử, phục hồi và Preset 1 đều miễn phí. MUSQ Premium thêm các lỗi thường gặp được vẽ trực tiếp trên người tập, Preset 2 và 3 cho mọi nhóm cơ, đồng thời gỡ bỏ quảng cáo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every goal is in. A walk still counts." : {
