    },
    "If you ask MUSQ's coach how to improve it, the question and your numbers are put in the chat box for you to read and edit before you send. Your sleep numbers go only if you choose to include them, and then stay in the chat on your %@, never in backups, until you clear it." : {

    },
    "If you use insulin or medicines that lower blood sugar, check it before and after training and keep fast sugar with you. Check your feet for blisters or sores. With eye or nerve complications, ask your doctor before heavy lifting." : {

    },
