    "MUSQ answered" : {
      "comment" : "Text to announce when the assistant has answered a question.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "MUSQ averages your steps over the last %@ full days, skipping days under %@ steps (a phone left at home), and needs at least %@ of them. Steps during your logged MUSQ workouts don't count, since your training days already do. Under %@ steps a day counts as “%@”, %@ to %@ as “%@”, and %@ or more as “%@”, in place of your answer to the daily-activity question. So that one long walk doesn't move your calories, the level changes only once your average is %@ steps past the line." : {
      "comment" : "How Apple Health steps set the calorie plan's daily activity. The quoted names are the daily-activity answers.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "MUSQ averages your steps over the last %1$@ full days, skipping days under %2$@ steps (a phone left at home), and needs at least %3$@ of them. Steps during your logged MUSQ workouts don't count, since your training days already do. Under %4$@ steps a day counts as “%5$@”, %6$@ to %7$@ as “%8$@”, and %9$@ or more as “%10$@”, in place of your answer to the daily-activity question. So that one long walk doesn't move your calories, the level changes only once your average is %11$@ steps past the line."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MUSQ can be wrong. For pain or a health condition, see a doctor." : {
      "comment" : "A footnote that warns that the AI can be wrong and advises against using it for health-related matters.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "MUSQ can't save to Photos" : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when the user denies access to Photos.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "MUSQ couldn't edit the photo right now. Check your connection and try again." : {

    },
    "MUSQ couldn't find a walk in that. Try “30 minutes” or “4,000 steps”." : {
      "comment" : "Text to be displayed in a toast if the user's voice input for a walk couldn't be understood.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "MUSQ couldn't find an amount in that. Try “500 ml” or “2 glasses”." : {
      "comment" : "Text to be displayed in a toast if the user's voice input for a water entry couldn't be understood.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "MUSQ couldn't keep this photo on your %@. Save it to Photos to keep it." : {

    },
    "MUSQ couldn't listen just now. Try again, or type it." : {
