      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "MUSQ couldn't read a meal from that. Try “chicken rice 650 kcal”." : {
      "comment" : "Text to be displayed in a toast if the user tries to log a meal but it's not in the expected format.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "MUSQ couldn't read the meal right now. Check your connection and try again." : {
