    "The account couldn't be deleted. Check your connection and try again." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when the user tries to delete",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The AI runs on MUSQ's server, which checks your purchase with Apple and keeps count of your allowance. Your workouts are kept on this %@: an AI feature sends only what its consent lists, after you agree. You can hide your email from MUSQ." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the AI feature that runs on MUSQ's server.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The App Store couldn't verify this purchase. Try again, or use Restore Purchases." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Store không xác minh được giao dịch mua này. Hãy thử lại hoặc dùng Khôi phục giao dịch mua."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The average of the last 7 days with a meal log or a check-in: protein 45% (full at 90% of your plan's), calories 40% (full within 10% of your plan, nothing at 30% off or under a safe minimum) and water 15%; with calorie numbers hidden, calories are left out. A check-in counts hit 1, close 0.6 and missed 0.3 for protein, and about right 1, a bit off 0.6 and way off 0.2 for eating. Needs 4 days." : {
      "comment" : "The text for the \"How it works\" section of the Balance settings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The bars rate what you did; the line is the result. Weight trails habits by a week or two, so read each point against the bars before it." : {
